@host = http://localhost:5205

### 0. Login inicial como Administrador (para obtener token)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "admin@itq.ec",
  "password": "Admin2026*"
}

###
@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

### 1. Registrar Administrador (espera 201)
POST {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Admin ITQ",
  "correo": "admin@itq.ec",
  "password": "Admin2026*",
  "rol": "Administrador"
}

### 2. Registrar Mesero (espera 201)
POST {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana Mesera",
  "correo": "ana@itq.ec",
  "password": "Mesero2026*",
  "rol": "Mesero"
}

### 3. Registrar Cocina (espera 201)
POST {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Luis Cocina",
  "correo": "luis@itq.ec",
  "password": "Cocina2026*",
  "rol": "Cocina"
}

### 4. Correo repetido, con mayúsculas y espacios (espera 409)
POST {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Otra Ana",
  "correo": "  ANA@itq.ec ",
  "password": "Mesero2026*",
  "rol": "Mesero"
}

### 5. Rol inventado (espera 400)
POST {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Pedro",
  "correo": "pedro@itq.ec",
  "password": "Chef2026*",
  "rol": "Chef"
}

### 6. Contraseña corta (espera 400)
POST {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Pedro",
  "correo": "pedro@itq.ec",
  "password": "123",
  "rol": "Mesero"
}

### 7. Listar usuarios (espera 200, sin passwordHash)
GET {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 8. Obtener usuario por Id (espera 200)
GET {{host}}/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
